message: "If you use KhemSAR in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "KhemSAR: Rigorous AI-Assisted QSAR/SAR Modeling, Scientific Tutoring, and Bioisosteric De Novo Design Platform"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24308701"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sbolivar16/KhemSAR"
url: "https://github.com/Sbolivar16/KhemSAR"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bolivar Avila"
    given-names: "Santiago Jr."
    affiliation: "Master's Program in Biotechnology, Universidad Libre, Barranquilla Campus, Colombia"
keywords:
  - QSAR
  - SAR
  - cheminformatics
  - drug discovery
  - bioisosterism
