  - applicability domain
  - OECD principles
  - matched molecular pairs
  - artificial intelligence
abstract: >-
  KhemSAR is a cross-platform (macOS, Linux, Windows), multilingual (Spanish, English,
  Portuguese) scientific platform combining an interactive AI Tutor for QSAR/SAR
  interpretation with a paper-ready QSAR/SAR modeling studio, multi-database
  retrieval (ChEMBL, PubChem, BindingDB, RCSB PDB, UniProt, AlphaFold DB, GtoPdb,
  Open Targets, COCONUT, UniChem), OECD-compliant validation, Matched Molecular
  Pairs, SHAP and atomic attribution maps, bioisosteric de novo generation, and
  3D conformer/receptor preparation for molecular docking and dynamics.
